{
  "id": 1114,
  "description": "## Calmshore\nCalmshore is a casual, non-competitive guild with no strict contribution requirements.\n\nWe accept players who enjoy relaxed incremental gameplay and want access to basic guild activities and mechanics (raid, challenge, repair maintenance, energizing Pools bonus) without pressure.  \n\nWe expect members to participate or contribute at their own pace — every little bit helps.\n\nJoining Requirement: Combat Lv. 50\n\nDue to prolonged non-participation from past members, members are now required to participate in any guild activity at least once every 3 weeks.\n\nKick: After 4 days of profile inactivity or 3 weeks of guild inactivity.\nYou will be sent a final notice before being kicked.\n\nRaid: 2x Daily - Discord has role ping.  \nOrbit of the Forgotton (Combat Lv.80) (60 minutes) - Celestial Observatory\n\n1st Raid: PST 6pm, CST 8pm, EST 9pm, UTC 1am, AWST 9am  \n2nd Raid: PST 7am, CST 9am, EST 10am, UTC 2pm, AWST 10pm\n\nEnergizing Pools activated on SAT &amp; SUN (America) / SUN &amp; MON (Eurasia) after 1st raid.  \n(SAT/SUN) PST 7pm, CST9pm, EST 10pm, (SUN/MON) UTC 2am, AWST 10am  \n\nOur Discord: https://discord.gg/Np2jQR4BCz\n\nCurrent Goal:  \nComplete Guild Challenges to afford weekly Guild Raids &amp; Energizing Pools  \nMaintain Repair Material in Stockpile\n\n[HISTORY]  \n20251212 Guild Established, transferred from &#039;Harem Kings&#039; Guild  \n20260207 Guild Lv. 60  \n20260323 Guild Lv. 70  \n20260403 Built Energizing Pools  \n20260608 Guild Lv. 80  \n20260803 Guild Lv. 85  \n\n### | GUILD BOARD |\n\n[GUILD MARKS]  \nEach completed Guild Challenge add 1 mark. A raid cost 3 marks &amp; Energizing Pools  cost 5 marks per activation.\n\n[CONTRIBUTION]  \nContribute at your own pace.  \n- Join a raid. (Lv. 70 raid rewards 2.1k gold, 23k Combat EXP, 25k Guild Mastery EXP)\n- Contribute to Guild Challenge. We appreciate all the help we can get.\n- Deposit to Stockpile to repair guild components as soon as possible to save cost.\n\n### | Posted on 20261023 |\n\nGuild Slayer postpone indefinetely.  \nNext immediate guild raid will be at Event Area.\n\nEve of Shadows campaign event has started!  \nTo participate in this event, move your characters to the new event area. The final reward is an event pet, Gromley.\n\nTo obtained all campaign rewards:  \n6365 campaign points, or  \n38190x Carved Pumpkin / 25460x Treat Bag / 6365x Essence of a Ghost\nThis does not count points exchangeable from Event Tickets.\n\nCompletion time varies based on your seasonal skill mastery.\n\nActivities:\n- Community Goal Tier Bonus - Shrine-like passive bonus. Each tier update becomes outdated &amp; requires a contribution of at least 1 point to reactivate.\n- Seasonal Contest Battle - **MUST CLICK &#039;PARTICIPATE&#039;** to be eligible for Shards reward, no need to join in the contest activity itself - Randomly assign you in 3 teams to compete via points &amp; &quot;pumpkin&quot; other players&#039; profiles during battle.\n- Event Boss - 2 bosses at event area. Drop Event Tickets &amp; rare World Boss Magic Find consumable (0.05% drop rate).\n- Event Guild Raid - 20 mins. Drop Event Tickets.\n\nOptional:\n- Event Quest - 500 shards\n- Event Dungeon - Test your luck, stack dungeon magic find here. Drop rare Dungeon Magic Find consumable (0.02% drop rate).\n- Event League - A seasonal skill mastery league. Only Top 25 teams are eligible for shards reward + 150%.\n- Market Opportunity - Sell event tickets in the market. Market demand fluctuates during the event.\n\n### | Posted on 20261028 |\n\nOur members want to complete &quot;Contribute ### items to Guild Challenges&quot; Campaign Task to gain points.  \nFor the duration of the event, please refrain from completing Guild Challenges in one go, let other members have their chance at gaining points.  \n\nSince many are actively monitoring, we should be able to complete them when they are close to expire.  \nI.E. completing challenges when they are less than 6-8 hours would probably be ideal.   \nThank you for your cooperation :D Have fun Shadow Skilling.",
